.TH SYSINFO 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sysinfo \- read Linux system statistics
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/sysinfo.h>
.B int sysinfo(struct sysinfo* information);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads uptime, load averages, process count and memory statistics.  Memory
values are in units of mem_unit bytes; load averages use SI_LOAD_SHIFT
fractional bits.  The structure uses the Linux x86\-64 ABI.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sysinfo (2)
